- scripts/check-workspace-metadata.py — passed.
- run_probes.py — passed against code revision 224b5c26f2f52ef87ff7f97069a2946dd7e48601. Producer and Lite shutdown finished in about 5 seconds for batch sizes 1 and 4 and stopped their trace producers; malformed contexts did not prevent a subsequent valid trace send; callback-group probes observed the current group while preserving the business SEND group.
- git diff --check and the final ignored-evidence audit are recorded at completion. Evidence remains under evidence/plan/2026/10/06-project-parity-fifth-review-fix-evidence/; /evidence/ is ignored and git ls-files evidence/ is empty.
